OL,3,GNEWSAPeople in 1066 country get
OL,4,Atapestry ticket priority
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living near the site of the
OL,7,FBattle of Hastings are being given
OL,8,Fpriority access to buy tickets to see
OL,9,Fthe Bayeux Tapestry in London.
OL,11,FHastings MP Helena Dollimore said
OL,12,Fresidents in the area would be able to
OL,13,Fsecure exhibition tickets before the
OL,14,Fgeneral sale.
OL,16,FResidents can book by calling the
OL,17,FBritish Museum box office and will need
OL,18,Fto provide a postcode and use a payment
OL,19,Fcard registered to a Hastings or Rother
OL,20,Fbilling address.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
