OL,3,GNEWSAPeople in 1066 country get
OL,4,Atapestry ticket priority
OL,5,
OL,6,FDollimore said the return of the Bayeux
OL,7,FTapestry to the UK, after its loan from
OL,8,FFrance, was the "exhibition of a
OL,9,Fgeneration".
